{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/03_반복문/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"v-for\" style=\"position:relative;\">v-for<a href=\"#v-for\" aria-label=\"v for permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>v-for=“작명 in 몇번반복” :key=“작명”</p>\n<p>:key 속성은 반복문 돌릴 때 꼭 필요하다. 반복한 요소들을 각각 구분짓기 위한 속성이다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;a v-for=&quot;작명 in 3&quot; :key=&quot;작명&quot;&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"data를-활용한-v-for\" style=\"position:relative;\">data를 활용한 v-for<a href=\"#data%EB%A5%BC-%ED%99%9C%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%9C-v-for\" aria-label=\"data를 활용한 v for permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>3의 자리에는 데이터를 넣을 수가 있음<br>\n메뉴들의 갯수만큼 반복됨 작명한 변수는 데이터 안의 자료가 됨</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;a v-for=&quot;작명 in 메뉴들&quot; :key=&quot;작명&quot;&gt;{{작명}}&lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;App&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      메뉴들: [&#39;Home&#39;, &#39;Shop&#39;, &#39;About&#39;],\r\n      products : [&#39;역삼동원룸&#39;, &#39;천호동원룸&#39;, &#39;마포구원룸&#39;]\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  components: {}\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"keyi\" style=\"position:relative;\">:key=“i”<a href=\"#keyi\" aria-label=\"keyi permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>의 용도는 반복문으로 생성한 요소들을 구분하기 위한 속성<br>\n(a, i) 에는 각각 item, idx가 들어간다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>a</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">v-for</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>(a,i) in 메뉴들<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">:key</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>i<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>{{a}}<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>a</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"예제\" style=\"position:relative;\">예제<a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"예제 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div class=&quot;menu&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;a v-for=&quot;(a,i) in 메뉴들&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot;&gt;{{a}}&lt;/a&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;div v-for=&quot;(a,i) in products&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;h4&gt;{{a}}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;40 만원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;App&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      // 데이터 보관함\r\n      // 데이터는 object 자료형으로 저장한다. {자료이름:자료내용}\r\n      메뉴들: [&#39;Home&#39;, &#39;Shop&#39;, &#39;About&#39;],\r\n      products : [&#39;역삼동원룸&#39;, &#39;천호동원룸&#39;, &#39;마포구원룸&#39;]\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  components: {}\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#v-for\">v-for</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#data%EB%A5%BC-%ED%99%9C%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%9C-v-for\">data를 활용한 v-for</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#keyi\">:key=“i”</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\">예제</a></li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"03. 반복문 v-for","summary":"v-for v-for=\"작명 in 몇번반복\" :key=\"작명\" :key 속성은 반복문 돌릴 때 꼭 필요하다. 반복한 요소들을 각각 구분짓기 위한 속성이다. <a v-for=\"작명 in 3\" :key=\"작명\">Home</a> data를 활용한 v-for 3의 자리에는 데이터를 넣을 수가 있음 메뉴들의 갯수만큼 반복됨 작명한 변수는 데이터 안의 자료가 됨","date":"Jun 12, 2023","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/03_반복문/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/02_데이터바인딩/","title":"02. vuedongsan 데이터 바인딩"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/vue/04_이벤트바인딩/","title":"04. 이벤트 바인딩 v-on, @, 함수"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}